{
  "item": "Lugard",
  "mu_name": "Lugard",
  "mu_name_from": "NPC/Lugard.bmd, loaded as MODEL_DOPPELGANGER_NPC_LUGARD (ZzzOpenData.cpp:2173-2176, its textures out of Npc\\), MuMain's MONSTER_LUGARD, type 540 (_enum.h:4868, ZzzCharacter.cpp:14950-14955), the Doppelganger event's keeper in later seasons. Not Version075's.",
  "world": "devias",
  "object_type": -1,
  "why_this_one": "The reset keeper: the user's pick on 2026-10-22 from the unused MU NPCs ('Lugard could work'), a dark knight seated on a stone block, his sword planted before him, two spectral wings floating apart from him -- the light from the sky the reset ceremony brings down. First placed on Lorencia's centre by the fountain, then moved to Devias at 207,45 on the snow between the cobbled paths, by the user's word ('lets move him here', 'rset npc'). 67 bones, 6 meshes, one action.",
  "profile": "npc",
  "scale": 1.1,
  "scale_from": "CreateCharacter stands him at `c->Object.Scale = 1.1f` (ZzzCharacter.cpp:14954), MU's own; carried as the figure's scale. His `m_fEdgeScale = 1.2f`, the picked outline, is not carried.",
  "sheets": {
    "NPC_dopleganger_cloth": "npc_npc_dopleganger_cloth.png",
    "NPC_dopleganger_head": "npc_npc_dopleganger_head.png",
    "NPC_dopleganger_body": "npc_npc_dopleganger_body.png",
    "NPC_dopleganger_sward": "npc_npc_dopleganger_sward.png",
    "NPC_dopleganger_stone": "npc_npc_dopleganger_stone.png",
    "NPC_dopleganger_wing": "npc_npc_dopleganger_wing.png"
  },
  "sheet_from": "Out of MuMain's Data/NPC, beside the model, decoded under an npc_ prefix, lower case. Five .OZJ, no alpha; the wing is .OZT, its alpha cutting away 60%. NPC_dopleganger_r.OZJ sits beside them, but no mesh names it.",
  "sheet_materials": {
    "NPC_dopleganger_cloth": "cloth",
    "NPC_dopleganger_head": "skin",
    "NPC_dopleganger_body": "plate_steel",
    "NPC_dopleganger_sward": "blade_steel",
    "NPC_dopleganger_stone": "rock",
    "NPC_dopleganger_wing": "feather"
  },
  "sheet_materials_from": "cloth the strip of red cloth at his waist; head his face; body his black and gilt plate; sward the planted sword; stone the block he sits on; wing the two floating wings.",
  "cutout": [
    "NPC_dopleganger_wing"
  ],
  "cutout_from": "NPC_dopleganger_wing is .OZT, its alpha cut.",
  "glow": {
