      "over": true
    }
  },
  "glow_from": "RenderObjectMesh's MODEL_DOPPELGANGER_NPC_LUGARD case (ZzzObject.cpp:2311-2322) draws meshes 0-4 once, then mesh 5, the wings, at BodyLight 1 and a second time RENDER_TEXTURE | RENDER_BRIGHT: `over`, as the Archangel's ng01 is.",
  "sound_from": "MoveCharacter plays SOUND_DOPPELGANGER_LUGARD_BREATH (Data/Sound/Doppelganger/Lugard.wav) while he stands in MONSTER01_STOP1 (ZzzCharacter.cpp:15199-15205). Not carried yet: a new sound needs its own cook.",
  "islands_from": "The build fills this.",
